# NOTE: web-dist/ (the built React/Three.js web UI) is intentionally TRACKED.
# server.py mounts it at "/" and it is the only frontend a fresh clone gets:
# without the bundle committed, `python -m infra_inventory app` has no route for
# "/" and people fall back to the standalone CLI point-cloud viewer instead of
# the real platform. Rebuild it after changing web/src:
#     cd web && npm install && npm run build
